(global_label "CELL_MON_ALERT_L" (shape bidirectional) (at 320.0000 208.0000 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify right)) (uuid "482b4227-669e-4a98-b5d8-6cff4a8b94d8"))
(text "4S CELL INPUT MAP (TI datasheet Table 7-1):" (at 25 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left)) (uuid "5780f24a-794d-4ac0-9984-2f3cb01d4e1e"))
(text "CELL1 = VC1-VC0; CELL2 = VC2-VC1; CELL3 = VC4B-VC3A; CELL4 = VC5-VC4A." (at 25 36 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left)) (uuid "8f471d2e-2dcd-4614-9302-8b9e9c31ede0"))
(text "4S shorts: VC4A=VC4B; VC3A=VC3B=VC2. These are common nets, not omitted pins." (at 25 42 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left)) (uuid "025543c9-3c82-4e8c-aa75-5ef86dfa0d94"))
(text "R801-R805 = 10 Ω series; C801-C805 = 220 nF differential / VC0-to-VSS filter candidates." (at 25 48 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "47102664-68a6-40e6-988a-3887ac255b22"))
(text "Input filter values follow the TI BQ76905EVM example as a starting point; verify against cell-tap wiring and open-wire test." (at 25 54 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "dbc30d0b-0287-4a35-87c8-f0fe41369a4b"))
(text "BAT: diode + 100 Ω + 1 µF. REGSRC: separate diode + 10 Ω + 1 µF. REGOUT: 1 µF." (at 25 60 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "5a9582ee-ef45-4f6f-959b-cd8b8629e4c8"))
(text "SRP/SRN/TS unused -> VSS. DSG/CHG unused -> NC. Do not connect BQ low-side drivers to the existing high-side P-MOS path." (at 25 66 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "45dbad69-1f59-4f87-b33b-227c343fd40a"))
(text "CELL_MON_ALERT_L is open-drain and pulled up to REGOUT. CELL_CONFIG_VALID must be generated by the host only after full config readback." (at 25 230 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "449e05b3-3a8e-4683-b05d-277e18588f6e"))
(text "CELL_MON_PG requires an external hardware supervisor; it is not a BQ76905 output. Footprint/land pattern must be verified before PCB release." (at 25 236 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "0cc09bc2-f13f-4c8a-94f7-eb525df216e1"))
(text "BQ76905 is a battery monitor used here as a candidate supercapacitor monitor. 1.05 V CUV accuracy and response delay are not yet qualified." (at 25 242 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "53e8ea48-9343-4863-8603-1e1517a43bf0"))
)